which means we know the exact order in which the nodes should be created.</=
p>
<blockquote>
<p>As we=E2=80=99re building the tree using preorder traversal, the next no=
de to be created at any point will be the next value in the preorder array.=
 This means we can iterate through the preorder array to place each new nod=
e.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Based on this, we know the next node to be placed will have a value of 9=
